  "solution": {
    "text": "For the reaction  <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⇌</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> , <br/><br/>Rate  <math><mo>∝</mo><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>[</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msup></math> . On substituting the given data, we get<br/><br/>From experimental 1,  <math><mn>1.6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>∝</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0.50</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0.50</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msup></math>        ...(i)<br/><br/>From experimental 2,  <math><mn>3.2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>∝</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0.50</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1.00</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup></math>        ...(ii)<br/><br/>From experimental 3,  <math><mn>3.2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>∝</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1.00</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1.00</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup></math>        ...(iii)<br/><br/> <math><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.00</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.50</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/>or  <math><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup></math>  or  <math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup></math>  or  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br/><br/>Now, divide equation (ii) by equation (i) we get,<br/><br/> <math><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.00</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.50</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/> <math><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> <br/><br/>Thus rate equation is: Rate  <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> .",
